# Upstream pushes daily prerelease tags (vX.Y.Z.devYYYYMMDD, vX.Y.Zrc1) that
# pollute the tag list and the releases.atom feed; nix-update otherwise picks
# the newest of those. GitHub *releases* only carry the stable vX.Y.Z tags, so
# prefer them, and pin the regex to plain three-component versions as a belt.
--use-github-releases
--version-regex
^v([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$
